One Person Company - Services Business Entrepreneur
Core Business Idea
The idea is to create a set of skills that asks users a series of questions using the RALPH method. (The RALPH method is an autonomous AI methodology that uses iterative loops to continuously plan, implement, test, and improve until all tasks are successfully completed.) Based on their answers, the system helps users transform from absolute beginners into "One-Person Business Corporation" entrepreneurs.
The concept focuses mainly on service-based business ideas and includes a prompts and skills repository.
The goal is to guide professionals into becoming what I call a "One-Person Full-Stack Business Entrepreneur",someone who can run and handle every role within their own business as a true one-person operation, all powered by AI.
My primary customers are young entrepreneurs and freelancers. Ultimately, it functions as a live business idea generator and progress tracker rolled into one.
The user answers some questions and the set of skills generates a complete business blueprint covering every stage of Service business creation.
